Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.26,0:00:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.40,0:00:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.96,0:00:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that can't be beaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.02,0:00:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past every wall that's\Nin our wake, go without hesitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.78,0:00:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.86,0:00:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to press on a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.70,0:00:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,To get to the answers we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We came to this new world believing That
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.82,0:00:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,surely someday we just might find the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All the pieces of our dreams\Nhave now come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Our bonds won't waver.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.38,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With our dreaming hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on towards
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.66,0:00:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A bright new future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.78,0:00:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.62,0:00:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.68,0:01:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.30,0:01:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.48,0:01:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on never stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.42,0:01:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your head up way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.42,0:01:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.12,0:01:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If waves are rough, jump to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.08,0:01:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.88,0:01:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Our wishes, they will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.86,0:01:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.66,0:01:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We drift on riding the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.92,0:01:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Towards another shore day by day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There are many meetings, many goodbyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.58,0:01:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Underneath the flag we fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.06,0:01:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll remember the pain within.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep it in my heart forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.96,0:01:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And never take it lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.06,0:01:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This freedom I will keep in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.12,0:01:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep holding on, never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.72,0:01:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.52,0:01:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.60,0:02:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.26,0:02:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.32,0:02:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on, never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.96,0:02:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up, keep your\Nhead up, way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up, if brains\Nare rough, jump to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.02,0:02:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up, our wishes,\Nthey will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.72,0:02:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.08,0:02:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.82,0:02:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, sure looks like a warship.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.36,0:02:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So, the navy's on the\Nisland? What? Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.14,0:02:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,When did they get here? Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.42,0:02:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got company!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.94,0:02:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I know him! Hey! Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.48,0:02:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.18,0:02:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember me, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.14,0:02:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You helped me out that one time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.66,0:02:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.28,0:02:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.28,0:03:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the guy we met at\Nthe human shop in Sabaody.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.22,0:03:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Trafalgar Law, but why is he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.72,0:03:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Right! Traffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.70,0:03:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He helped me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.10,0:03:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys know, back in the\NBattle of Marine Corps,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.82,0:03:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,he got me off the field and treated\Nmy wounds. He did? Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.58,0:03:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He saved my life like Jinbei.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.44,0:03:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm gonna go talk\Nto him right now. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.66,0:03:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to run into you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.64,0:03:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Small world, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.84,0:03:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.94,0:03:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe you one. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.24,0:03:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Vix!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.15,0:03:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, uh, where'd your buddies go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.52,0:03:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, hand over Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.86,0:03:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand him over and we can escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.72,0:03:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll die without my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.54,0:03:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, I'm a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.68,0:03:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.26,0:03:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What will happen to him if he\Nremains in that state? Simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.44,0:04:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If he keeps flailing around, the\Nmore likely he is to open his wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.94,0:04:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And if that happens,\Nchances are he'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.50,0:04:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs to rest, for two weeks at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.02,0:04:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it, or he won't heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.80,0:04:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand, and thank\Nyou for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.28,0:04:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.34,0:04:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like you pulled\Nthrough, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.02,0:04:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, glad my treatment took, but\Nyou don't have to thank me for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.56,0:04:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it on a whim, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.42,0:04:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not buddies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.40,0:04:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget, we're both pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.50,0:04:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.41,0:04:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Opponents, rivals, enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.58,0:04:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But enemy or not, you\Nstill help me. So thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.28,0:04:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.70,0:04:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,First Team Bay and now you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.18,0:04:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting a lot of thank\Nyous checked off my list.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.52,0:04:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, over there, on the ground, a Marine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.38,0:04:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that who I think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.76,0:04:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I get a little help here, Trafalgar?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.88,0:04:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.10,0:05:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.30,0:05:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.36,0:05:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Smoker!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.18,0:05:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Smoking!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.14,0:05:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Marines!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.34,0:05:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that girl! I know her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.56,0:05:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, we got Marines headed our way! Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.14,0:05:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you see? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.42,0:05:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You think smoking's alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.68,0:05:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Please wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.48,0:05:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.82,0:05:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Smokey and his crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.16,0:05:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Long time no see!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.86,0:05:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a hole in his chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.54,0:05:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Smoker, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.68,0:05:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to become a member\Nof the Seven Warlords,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.30,0:05:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,he delivered the hearts of a hundred\Npirates to the Navy Headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.12,0:05:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He's off the rails!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.72,0:06:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.06,0:06:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,damn you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.18,0:06:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,damn you, damn you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.60,0:06:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,damn you, come on, really,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.54,0:06:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate this kind of thing, too much drama,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.86,0:06:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,room,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.70,0:06:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Shambles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.30,0:06:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, damn, he took her down again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.04,0:06:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Smokey isn't moving either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.68,0:06:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they both dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.74,0:06:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Once wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.72,0:07:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I win again, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.50,0:07:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Loopy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.41,0:07:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our cue to get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.06,0:07:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on. Hey, you! Traffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.96,0:07:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Got a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.68,0:07:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Head over to the lab, around the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.64,0:07:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,When you get there, you'll\Nfind what you're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.34,0:07:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll meet again soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.52,0:07:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We both have things we mean to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.88,0:07:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He met me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.12,0:07:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going to save me from this indignity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.36,0:07:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a former pirate, not a horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.80,0:07:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get as far away from\Nthose Navy Pucks as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.22,0:07:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Think Smokey's going to be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.12,0:07:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That looked rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.20,0:07:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Traffy didn't go easy on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.40,0:07:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, guys, it's\NStraw Hat Luffy. Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.14,0:07:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Planet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.05,0:08:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.52,0:08:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Smokey's down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.43,0:08:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The captain, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.90,0:08:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares about the\Nsamurai and the breads?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.70,0:08:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Not me, I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.74,0:08:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,More importantly, where\Ncan I find a camera?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.04,0:08:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta take some pictures\Nbefore we all change back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.28,0:08:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Pictures of what, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.86,0:08:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Then stop making my nose bleed,\Nor your nose, or whatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.70,0:08:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're making demands, Nami, then unbutton\Nmy shirt so I can show off my Mechapex!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.42,0:08:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.58,0:08:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.49,0:08:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We can make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.54,0:08:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll figure something out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.00,0:08:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I liked it better when\Nyou weren't so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.06,0:08:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is kind of creeping me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.66,0:08:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.72,0:08:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Did someone play a trick\Nand make you switch bodies?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.62,0:08:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so cold without my fur!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.54,0:08:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You humans sure do have it rough!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.56,0:08:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta stop. He needs help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.50,0:08:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.46,0:08:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.60,0:08:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.30,0:09:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.42,0:09:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to get scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.88,0:09:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.79,0:09:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't have taken the kids with\Nus until we figured out where to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.44,0:09:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,On the upside, I don't feel cold\Nat all with Chopper's fur on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.10,0:09:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I've got enough fur\Nfor a couple of coats.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.66,0:09:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.57,0:09:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my body!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.10,0:09:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine, but I don't think we're gonna\Nfind any warm clothing just lying around
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.44,0:09:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe there's a lodge or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.24,0:09:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah with a mirror and a camera
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.70,0:09:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And a shower would be nice
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.04,0:09:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, I can see we\Nhave no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.36,0:09:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I need all of you to place a\Nleaf upon your heads Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.00,0:09:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would we do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.16,0:09:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't joke, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.24,0:09:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The poor kiddos are gonna collapse\Nfrom the cold Besides, what leaves?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.76,0:09:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There aren't any.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.82,0:09:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.76,0:09:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no plants.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.84,0:09:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine. Forget leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.32,0:09:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Start gathering some stones instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.40,0:09:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.82,0:09:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, we'll do it, but this\Nhad better not be a prank.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.40,0:09:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get them for the kids, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.32,0:10:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.26,0:10:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got the rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.58,0:10:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you don't do some stupid spell\Nlike abracadabra, make it not cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.62,0:10:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'd kill you all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.78,0:10:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Poof.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.62,0:10:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You do,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.53,0:10:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,you're welcome, small one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.70,0:10:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I have not always possessed the strange\Nability, but one day I ate a fruit,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.60,0:10:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,an unusual one,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.16,0:11:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,and since then I have been able to\Ndisguise myself and others as I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.02,0:11:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I know little of foreign clothing;\NI hope this will suffice also,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.04,0:11:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,due to the nature of the magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.46,0:11:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The clothes will disappear\Nif you remove them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.58,0:11:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He covered my boobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.40,0:11:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you'd eaten\Na Devil Fruit. What? Devil?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.84,0:11:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.56,0:11:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This whole time, you had that power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.00,0:11:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So why didn't you use it sooner?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.60,0:11:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I was helpless.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.54,0:11:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That little breastband she's wearing,\NI couldn't bring myself to cover it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.38,0:11:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Curve?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.92,0:11:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That... really...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.36,0:11:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,itches.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.56,0:11:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, say it. I'm hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.16,0:11:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Admitting that isn't going to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.32,0:11:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I itch. Oh, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.30,0:11:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Look who it is! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.80,0:12:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.50,0:12:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.92,0:12:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.42,0:12:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.82,0:12:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.73,0:12:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.98,0:12:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo-hoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.98,0:12:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.04,0:12:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.50,0:12:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro and Usopp, too! Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.44,0:12:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy to see you! What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.40,0:12:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why's the jackass cook\Nprancing around like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.26,0:12:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You've called us strange things to people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.96,0:12:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it just me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.36,0:12:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Are there giant children with them, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.34,0:12:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.25,0:12:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't do it! Franky! Down, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.88,0:12:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of the cold, finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.40,0:12:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This building reminds me\Na lot of the other one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.14,0:12:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But this one is badly damaged, as if\Nthere were some sort of explosion here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.34,0:12:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Long as it gets us out of that\Nblizzard, it's fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.48,0:13:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's talk. Who's up first?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.60,0:13:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I did that to my own body.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.88,0:13:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, let me see if I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.10,0:13:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Saatchi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.22,0:13:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your hands off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.94,0:13:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's me, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.10,0:13:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My legs are back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.50,0:13:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm almost told now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.04,0:13:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My extra legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.98,0:13:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on a set already!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.00,0:13:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.91,0:13:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You are never a centaur,\Nso just let it go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.60,0:13:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How very odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.40,0:13:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite a funny chap, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.72,0:13:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The skeleton...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.02,0:13:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,...is talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.22,0:13:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.13,0:13:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Do a trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.14,0:13:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the tank thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.70,0:14:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Not now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.20,0:14:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.11,0:14:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.26,0:14:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.76,0:14:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to be craving one. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.44,0:14:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you like to smoke\Nwhen you're stressed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.96,0:14:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So, smoke. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.42,0:14:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,First up, we're gonna need\Nto know who's who here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.86,0:14:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky, got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.34,0:14:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Not Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.44,0:14:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You get hurt, I'm useless. Remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.34,0:14:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey guys, Chopper speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.26,0:14:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have any injuries, come to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.66,0:14:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Nami, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.32,0:14:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No laser beams, no tanks, don't ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.86,0:14:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I present to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.50,0:14:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.84,0:14:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.98,0:14:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Defile my body again, I dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.86,0:14:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stop, I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.60,0:14:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't hurt Nami\Nagain, she's too pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.30,0:14:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.44,0:14:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be suicide!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.30,0:15:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Touch me and you get a fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.30,0:15:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,100,000 berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.82,0:15:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No, make it two.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.30,0:15:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But my dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.62,0:15:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.62,0:15:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't be so funny\Nif it happened to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.02,0:15:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start from the top and\Nmake sure we've got it straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.58,0:15:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This head and legs\Nbelong to a Wano samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.14,0:15:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The distress signal we\Nintercepted before coming to
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.64,0:15:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,the island was actually meant\Nfor the big boss crocotar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.64,0:15:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,and was sent by one of his men.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.76,0:15:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems our sliced-up samurai\Npal did some slicing
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.54,0:15:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,of his own with the centaurs\Non the receding end.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.36,0:15:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I fought them, but\Nonly to rescue my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.66,0:15:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.30,0:15:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He's missing, and those men\Nwere in my way. Just look!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.76,0:15:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You can see with your own eyes how many
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.74,0:15:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,children were prisoners\Nin that foul facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.30,0:15:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no doubt my son is one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.70,0:15:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there were others.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.72,0:15:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,More children like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.30,0:15:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess your son could be one\Nof them, but I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.52,0:15:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, but what happened\Nafter that distress signal?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.98,0:16:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the heck sliced you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.78,0:16:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The man we encountered, him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.12,0:16:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The one with the cold eyes and the\Nsilly cap who bears the title Warlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.10,0:16:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.26,0:16:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Traffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.70,0:16:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a Warlord now, really? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.88,0:16:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, a lot can change in two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.52,0:16:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard, he took his\Nblade and carved me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.26,0:16:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My head was kept in the facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.38,0:16:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My torso remained where it fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.90,0:16:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And my legs were chased\Naway by a vile beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.28,0:16:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They were making a\Nvaliant effort to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.82,0:16:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But they became stuck on something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.58,0:16:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Which was the dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.40,0:16:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That explains it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.46,0:16:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right, a warlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.32,0:16:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You were mad at one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.42,0:16:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.54,0:16:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, but it was just legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.26,0:16:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So how did he talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.80,0:16:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a real good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.60,0:16:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.30,0:16:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,By farting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.00,0:17:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a talent of mine.\NHere, I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.14,0:17:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Fart talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.52,0:17:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, gross. But useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.64,0:17:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't smell so bad outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.44,0:17:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you believe I met another\Npartial person recently?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.82,0:17:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a head and legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.56,0:17:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He just had a torso.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.00,0:17:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Fanny.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.94,0:17:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, because that\Nwas his torso, dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.46,0:17:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.94,0:17:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw it, skeleton? Truly?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.06,0:17:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is my torso?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.46,0:17:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We must go there at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.18,0:17:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole heart thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.88,0:17:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You doing okay without one?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.18,0:17:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.98,0:17:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Talking to her is hard enough, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.18,0:17:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a ship hidden\Nbeside the laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.74,0:17:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The letters CC were written on it. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.26,0:17:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know there was a ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.04,0:17:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw it, Vice Admiral?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.94,0:17:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.85,0:17:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,if it was left over from the old\Ndays before the island was destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.22,0:17:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,the mark should be PH for Punk Hazard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.50,0:18:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing that Law\Nisn't the mastermind here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.18,0:18:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone else is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.54,0:18:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone with the initial CC.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.24,0:18:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And I think I know who.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.92,0:18:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It would make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.94,0:18:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Him being here on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.66,0:18:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A lot of things are\Nstarting to fall into place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.62,0:18:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe the person behind this\Nis a former colleague of Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.48,0:18:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk A scientist named Caesar Clown
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.54,0:18:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavens, what have you done now, Law?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.98,0:18:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Well
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.72,0:18:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone's got a complaint, it's me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.58,0:18:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.96,0:19:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I have some\Ninformation that might help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.90,0:19:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.02,0:19:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I noticed something unusual a while back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.90,0:19:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Suspicious reports from this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.22,0:19:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A lot of reports, all of them\Nconcerning child abduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.56,0:19:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean like a kidnapping ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.92,0:19:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.70,0:19:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I can handle this, Cap!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.04,0:19:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like you're not you anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.84,0:19:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to suck it up, Marine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.36,0:19:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We're stuck like this for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.00,0:19:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Toshiki, get back on track.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.24,0:19:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,These reports you're talking about,\Nwhy haven't I heard of them before?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.08,0:19:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Please button up, I can't\Neven look at myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.54,0:19:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something wrong\Nabout seeing her like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.50,0:19:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I shouldn't like\Nit, but God help me, I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.26,0:19:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.76,0:19:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I have noticed that accidents at sea\Nhappen fairly frequently in this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.10,0:19:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And it does seem that an unusual\Nnumber involved children.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.04,0:20:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, that's true. Right? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.28,0:20:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing is, per the\Ncommunication department...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.92,0:20:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right, no glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.98,0:20:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, from what I've heard, we get\Na whole lot of abduction reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.06,0:20:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But somehow they always end up labeled\Nin the newspaper as accidents at sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.46,0:20:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,the work of pirates,\Nor simply a lost child.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.44,0:20:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And I guess it's possible the\Nincidents are reported incorrectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.80,0:20:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.22,0:20:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But unfortunately to me it seems\Nfar more likely that, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.88,0:20:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to finish\Nyour sentence, Tashigi?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.18,0:20:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,come on saying it out\Nloud won't change anything
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.82,0:20:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,we all know we saw a bunch\Nof kids on the island
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.68,0:20:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,earlier what you're too\Nafraid to say is you think
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.82,0:20:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,there really have been\Na series of kidnappings
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.84,0:20:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and you believe the perpetrator\Nis here on punk hazard
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.04,0:21:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,but if your suspicions\Nabout that are correct
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.26,0:21:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,those news articles\Nweren't simple mistakes the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.48,0:21:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,reporters were deliberately\Nmisled because someone in g5
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.46,0:21:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,wanted those abduction\Nreports covered up hold on
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.60,0:21:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,is smoky saying that somebody\Nin our ranks is working
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.46,0:21:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,with the kidnapper what\Nthe hell smokey happy for
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.58,0:21:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,a soldier crew like that\Nsure we're not the smartest
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.42,0:21:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,or strongest marines there\Nare but that doesn't change
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.02,0:21:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,the fact that We just tried\Nto be part of the maze!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.56,0:21:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit your bitching!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.46,0:21:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hurt us!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.72,0:21:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You fools couldn't\Nsteal candy from a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.20,0:21:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not even worth suspecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.94,0:21:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.06,0:21:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't let loyalty blind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.34,0:21:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even the Navy is immune to corruption.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.48,0:21:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,At the end of the day, the\NNavy is just a group of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.38,0:21:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And people aren't perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.42,0:21:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Making assumptions is dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.80,0:21:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be fooled by appearances.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.30,0:21:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.26,0:22:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,understood captain
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.18,0:22:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,never mind morons um guys\Ni'm the captain right sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.22,0:22:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,we're still getting used to\Nthis i could still be wrong i
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.28,0:22:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,don't have any proof it's a\Ntheory that's all that doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.32,0:22:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,matter theory or not it's\Nsomething we need to keep in mind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.98,0:22:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, as it stands, my heart\Nand both our bodies are at law's mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.16,0:22:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We're both stuck here till we settle that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.46,0:22:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But I want a third of you to leave by\Nship and report what we've found so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.86,0:22:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one problem with that, Vice Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.02,0:22:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If you remember, our\Nwarship was destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.60,0:22:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I saw a ship, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.54,0:22:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Steal it. Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.98,0:22:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I hadn't thought of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.40,0:22:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Stealing's bad, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.34,0:22:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do it, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.74,0:22:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And be careful nobody catches you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.08,0:22:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, I'm going to find a\Nway to get my heart and body back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.86,0:22:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and hunt down the twisted\Nbastard who's behind all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.40,0:23:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I was finally able to get through to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.48,0:23:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We have permission to kill them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.84,0:23:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hat Pirates, the G5\Ncrew, Foxfire Kin'emon as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.34,0:23:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter who dies on this island,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.68,0:23:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Joker will ensure the losses are\Nofficially listed as accidents at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.12,0:23:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch as many of them as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.86,0:23:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The more guinea pigs, the merrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.86,0:23:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, master.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.72,0:23:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I prefer them alive, but you may kill\Nany that can't be taken with poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.46,0:23:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did Law go?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.14,0:23:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He left the room a few minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.68,0:23:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.08,0:23:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,These pirates have large bounties.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.70,0:23:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,One is 400 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.50,0:23:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The others range from 50\Nberries to 120 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.98,0:23:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,All are wanted, and their total\Nbounties are 800 million and 50 berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.72,0:23:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They're notorious despite the fact they've\Nbeen enacted for the past two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.96,0:23:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Their bounties haven't\Nincreased in that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.66,0:24:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They could be more powerful\Nthan the numbers show.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.80,0:24:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're ever the font\Nof information, Monet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.92,0:24:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Help, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.46,0:24:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.38,0:24:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You look half frozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.38,0:24:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you been wandering\Naround outside without a coat?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.22,0:24:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We were robbed by pirates, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.18,0:24:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, what's worse is that the scheming\Nlowlights took Boss Brownbeard with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.30,0:24:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Master, we have to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.46,0:24:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.37,0:24:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,How absolutely terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.48,0:24:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about Brownbeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.90,0:24:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you we will retrieve him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.42,0:24:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go on back to the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.70,0:24:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,As it happens, you're in luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.96,0:24:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We've just finished a new medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.60,0:24:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly what you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.84,0:24:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It will both warm and heal you. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.04,0:24:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.76,0:24:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you help the others too?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.00,0:24:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.82,0:24:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, let's get you treated.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.32,0:24:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You do so much for us, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.08,0:24:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to repay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.48,0:24:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.76,0:25:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this, Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.40,0:25:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you're totally super, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.34,0:25:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.24,0:25:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.30,0:25:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.84,0:25:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing detracts from Nami's beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.64,0:25:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, quit whining.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.18,0:25:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Without some sort of system like this,\Nwe're never going to remember who's who.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.48,0:25:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a Brownbeard, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.94,0:25:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.85,0:25:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've heard that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.58,0:25:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's what I used to go by.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.52,0:25:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.70,0:25:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding, you fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.70,0:25:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.64,0:25:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't say a word before,\Nand now you won't stop yapping.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.92,0:25:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so eager\Nto run your mouth now?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.64,0:25:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh-ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.55,0:25:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in a good mood because\Nyou guys are in for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.24,0:25:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Law knows that I'm with you\Nnow, and he's gonna come for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.08,0:25:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I despise all the worthless\Npirates of your damn generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.06,0:25:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Law's the exception. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.48,0:25:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, our generation?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.30,0:25:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know anything, little fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.58,0:25:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean the 11 rookies\Nwith bounties over 100
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.62,0:25:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,million who arrived at\NSabaody two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.86,0:25:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You lot and Blackbeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.32,0:26:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,People call you puns the worst generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.50,0:26:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Troublemakers who were born\Nat the change of the era.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.58,0:26:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Reckless fools whose actions will\Ndetermine the future of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.02,0:26:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,After Whitebeard died, you all came to\Nthe new world and began raising hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.32,0:26:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Anytime something big happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.42,0:26:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,a member of your generation was\Nusually right in the thick of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.76,0:26:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackbeard, Kid, Law, Drake, and Hawkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.22,0:26:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Basil Hawkins was the one who shattered\Nmy crew, leaving us defeated and broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.64,0:26:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It was because of him that\Nmy pirate career ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.84,0:26:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The coward took my legs from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.84,0:26:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My crew was annihilated.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.82,0:26:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I was fleeing for my life\Nwhen at last I arrived here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.00,0:26:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,on the island known as Punk Hazard.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.64,0:26:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you fools even know\Nwhat this place is? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.92,0:26:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This island is not what it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.14,0:27:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It used to be a paradise\Nteeming with life,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.54,0:27:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,home to creatures of\Nall shapes and colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.04,0:27:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.00,0:27:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing like that anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.08,0:27:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This island housed a laboratory of a\Ngovernment scientist known as Dr. Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.88,0:27:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He and his team were\Nstationed here with the
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.90,0:27:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,task of developing new\Nchemicals and weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.74,0:27:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk needed subjects on\Nwhich to test his inventions,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.00,0:27:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,so instead of going to prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.04,0:27:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,criminals were sent here, where\Nthey were experimented on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.36,0:27:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Four years ago, Vegapunk tested one of\Nhis chemical weapons, and it went very,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.12,0:27:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,very wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.84,0:28:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Two of the three labs exploded,\Ndestroyed almost entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.06,0:28:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We are standing in the\Nremains of one right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.72,0:28:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.18,0:28:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A huge explosion would\Ndo this kind of damage,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.68,0:28:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,so Robin's theory was right after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.22,0:28:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Intense heat and toxic\Nsubstances seeped into the air,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.52,0:28:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,and none of the plants or\Nanimals on the island survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.32,0:28:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk's operation was shut down, and his\Nguinea pigs were thrown away like trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.90,0:28:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They did what they could to survive,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.16,0:28:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,taking shelter in the third\Nlaboratory, the only one
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.50,0:28:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,still intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.41,0:28:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There, they were protected from the poison\Ngas that contaminated the entire island.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.20,0:28:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who survived were paralyzed\Nfrom exposure to the gas,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.76,0:28:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,which stole the use of their lower
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.22,0:28:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.13,0:29:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They lived on, without any\Nreal hope for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.44,0:29:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, a year later, everything
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.80,0:29:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.71,0:29:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,A kind master arrived on the island,\Nrestoring the hope that had been
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.00,0:29:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.91,0:29:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,With his ability, he purified\Nthe island of the toxic gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.82,0:29:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He also gave the prisoners who couldn't\Nwalk the mechanical means to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.24,0:29:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,More than that, he gave them purpose\Nby making them his loyal subordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.84,0:29:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Kind master!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.94,0:29:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.48,0:29:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Merciful master!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.52,0:29:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I came to the island a year\Nafter that, desperate and broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.92,0:29:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Two years have passed since my arrival.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.74,0:29:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Some toxic substances\Nremained in the air even then,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.32,0:29:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,and breathing had left\Nme feeling nauseous.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.98,0:30:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I began to think I had no\Nmore strength to carry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.68,0:30:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I had fought to survive,\Nbut I was reaching the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.68,0:30:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But then I saw them, the men who had\Nlost the use of their legs just as I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.68,0:30:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And with them, the Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.08,0:30:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe everything to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.20,0:30:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,His kindness saved my life\Nas it saved others before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.52,0:30:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Vega Punk and his experiments\Nstole my comrade's legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.78,0:30:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But then the master arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.80,0:30:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A kind and generous savior.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.20,0:30:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And then a few months ago fate\Nbrought us another surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.90,0:30:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Trafalgar Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.46,0:30:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A warlord arrived on the island\Nand became our second savior.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.98,0:30:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Using his special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.74,0:30:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He gave legs to those of us who couldn't\Nwalk without mechanical assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.04,0:30:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They were the legs of living animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.62,0:31:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We thought we would never walk again?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.02,0:31:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,so we wept when our bodies were restored.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.42,0:31:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God, that's the\Nmost beautiful story ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.86,0:31:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, I told you Traffy was a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.42,0:31:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not the only one whose life he saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.84,0:31:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How could Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.90,0:31:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk do something so horrible?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.78,0:31:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess this explains the half-sheep\Npeople, the ones back at the laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.10,0:31:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Centaurs and the Bird Woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.40,0:31:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It all makes sense now, except\Nthe dragon. What's up with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.50,0:31:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.62,0:31:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Saw the dragon, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.38,0:31:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just an artificial\Ncreature Vegapunk
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.76,0:31:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,created to guard the island\Nfrom unwanted visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.96,0:31:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It can adapt to any\Nenvironment imaginable.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.30,0:31:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard one of the world nobles\Nliked it and gave it a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.66,0:31:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot what it was,\Nbut run if you see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.56,0:31:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's very aggressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.60,0:31:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.90,0:31:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We already ate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.98,0:31:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you know who's in charge on\Nthe island and why we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.10,0:31:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody else dares to come near it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.28,0:31:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It belongs to the Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.22,0:32:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Punk hazard is the domain of our savior.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.28,0:32:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.92,0:32:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The Master continues his research\Nfor the betterment of mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.82,0:32:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,To do so, he needs test subjects,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.90,0:32:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and each of you will have\Nthe honor of becoming one.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.66,0:32:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Like it or not, you're his.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.82,0:32:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.73,0:32:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something the matter? Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.22,0:32:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, I can't breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.62,0:32:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of medicine is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.30,0:32:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.36,0:32:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.44,0:32:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Please just let me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.90,0:32:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to hang on a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.86,0:32:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Describe how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.12,0:32:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,From the sound of it, there's\Nsome nausea and coughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.24,0:32:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Does your head hurt as well? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.80,0:32:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like it's going\Nto split open. Yes. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.42,0:33:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.66,0:33:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.57,0:33:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't Vegapunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.14,0:33:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But he was in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.08,0:33:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If Vegapunk didn't cause that\Nhuge explosion, who did, Smokey?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.36,0:33:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The person who made the weapon\Nand accidentally set it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.24,0:33:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That was Caesar Clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.94,0:33:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He and Vegapunk worked together.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.54,0:33:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar Clown was second in command here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.32,0:33:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But because of his tendency\Ntowards inhumane methods,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.64,0:33:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,he and Vegapunk butted heads frequently.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.18,0:33:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, please, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.48,0:33:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.84,0:33:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How are your eyes doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.52,0:33:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you seeing anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.24,0:33:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Strange
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.68,0:33:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.74,0:33:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.12,0:33:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye now
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.84,0:34:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,After the accident happened\NVegapunk was listed as
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.06,0:34:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,responsible because he was the\Nperson in charge Of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.14,0:34:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,it was a crime to develop\Na chemical weapon of mass
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.76,0:34:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,destruction that could\Ntake out an entire island.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.42,0:34:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,When Caesar Clown's involvement came to\Nlight after the explosion, he was arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.00,0:34:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But, using his formidable ability,\Nhe escaped from a prison ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.86,0:34:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And his location has been unknown since.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.74,0:34:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If my suspicions are correct and Caesar is
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.34,0:34:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,back here on this island\Nconducting experiments,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.64,0:34:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,we have to stop him\Nbefore he does something.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.24,0:34:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,even more horrible than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.70,0:34:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.72,0:34:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Was this one another failure? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.12,0:34:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Failure, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.66,0:34:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You really should watch your tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.20,0:35:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My experiments are never failures,\Nnot even what happened four years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.24,0:35:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,None of the useless idiots in the world\Ngovernment know what they're talking
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.62,0:35:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,about a failed experiment i developed\Na weapon that killed an entire island
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.76,0:35:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,how is that anything\Nbut a success i proved
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.08,0:35:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,myself the most efficient\Nkiller in the world
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.88,0:35:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,didn't i i meticulously\Ndocument each of my
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.10,0:35:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,victims until they draw their final breath
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.96,0:35:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,just you wait soon it\Nwill be my day and they'll
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.12,0:35:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,know i'm the greatest\Nscientist to ever live
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.80,0:35:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.20,0:35:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
